      "id": "markdown-1",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "Grid has explicit saved-version publication, folder-backed…",
      "text": "Grid has explicit saved-version publication, folder-backed content pools, optional cover images and a public read API for published pages and their assets. Since 15 November 2026, production reads use workspace API keys. The renderer shares the document model used by the editor and supports the built-in text, media, shape and layout features.",
